{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42740","headline":"蜀都春晚感怀 · 刘兼","name":"蜀都春晚感怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蜀都春色渐离披，梦断云空事莫追。\n宫阙一城荒作草，王孙犹自醉如泥。\n谁家玉笛吹残照，柳市金丝拂旧堤。\n可惜锦江无锦濯，海棠花下杜鹃啼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42740.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42740","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}